[size=6]Fort Resource[/size]
[size=4]
Modders resource for Skyrim forts. Features two navmeshed fort interiors, and Stormclock / Thalmor banner textures to match the generic banner mesh.

[size=5]Forts[/size]
Load the [b]fort-resource.esp[/b] file as a plugin file and the target project as the active file. Duplicate chosen cells and then reload the target project without the fort resource.

[list]
[*] AAFRFort01
[list][*] Navmesh: True
[/list]
[*] AAFRFort02
[list][*] Navmesh: True
[*] Variation Markers: AAFR02ImperialMarker, AAFR02StormcloakMarker
[/list][/list]

[size=5]Banners[/size]
Texture files need to be loaded as texture objects to apply them to banner objects in Creation Kit. The [b]fort-resource-banners.esp[/b] provides a complete demo, banners can be previewed in the [b]AAFRBanner01[/b] cell. The preview cell also includes the default Imperial banner that matches the generic banner size for reference.

[list]
[*] Texture Objects
[list][*] AAFRBannerStormcloak
[*] AAFRBannerThalmor
[/list]
[*] Banner Objects
[list][*] AAFRBannerStormcloak01, AAFRBannerStormcloak02, AAFRBannerStormcloak03, AAFRBannerStormcloak04
[*] AAFRBannerThalmor01, AAFRBannerThalmor02, AAFRBannerThalmor03, AAFRBannerThalmor04
[/list][/list]
[/size]

